Full licence text:       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
Upstream dataset:        https://github.com/JianhuiWei7/MedEthicsQA

Licence basis
-------------
The source repository carries no LICENSE file, so the licence is taken from the
authors' own declaration in the paper. The abstract of arXiv:2506.22808 states
that the dataset is "registered under CC BY-NC 4.0 license".

Note that the arXiv submission itself is published under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. That
covers the article, not the dataset; the dataset terms are the CC BY-NC 4.0
stated above.

NON-COMMERCIAL: this subset may not be used for commercial purposes under any
circumstances. Any commercial use of this repository must exclude it.

Citation
--------
Wei, J. et al. MedEthicsQA: A Comprehensive Question Answering Benchmark for
Medical Ethics Evaluation of LLMs. Preprint at arXiv
https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.22808 (2025).


Ethics Evaluation of LLMs. arXiv:2506.22808.

Files in this directory
-----------------------
  medethicsqa.json

Modifications
-------------
The data here is not the upstream distribution. It has been modified as follows,
and these changes are the responsibility of the Prj-BENCH authors, not the
upstream authors:

  - Converted to the common Prj-BENCH multiple-choice JSON schema
    (id / question / options / target / kind).
  - Randomly sampled 1,000 items, stratified evenly across the four core
    medical-ethics principles.
  - Quality-control exclusions applied; see ../../_dropped_items.csv.
